/trending/neil-degrasse-tyson-calls-moon-landing-denial-a-disconnect-from-reality-on-logan-pauls-podcast/articleshow/126322639.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/neil-degrasse-tyson-calls-moon-landing-denial-a-disconnect-from-reality-on-logan-pauls-podcast/articleshow/126322639.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T00:10:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126326907,imgsize-869545.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian national thrashed by transwomen in Thailand after refusing to pay for escort service]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126327519.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-national-raj-jasuja-thrashed-by-transwomen-in-thailand-after-allegedly-refusing-to-pay-for-escort-service/articleshow/126327519.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-national-raj-jasuja-thrashed-by-transwomen-in-thailand-after-allegedly-refusing-to-pay-for-escort-service/articleshow/126327519.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T01:14:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126327519,imgsize-766254.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Are Venezuelans happy Maduro is gone? Diaspora celebrates 'day of freedom']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126327548.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/are-venezuelans-happy-maduro-is-gone-diaspora-celebrates-day-of-freedom/articleshow/126327548.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/are-venezuelans-happy-maduro-is-gone-diaspora-celebrates-day-of-freedom/articleshow/126327548.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T01:13:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126327561,imgsize-1362838.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Famous Turkish twitch streamer Elraenn switches to Kick — Here’s everything to know]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126327372.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Popular Turkish streamer Elraenn has moved to Kick. He gained over a million followers on the new platform. Elraenn was a major streamer on Twitch with millions of followers. Changes in his home country influenced his decision. Kick offers better revenue and fewer restrictions. This move highlights how streamers adapt to new platforms for growth and audience connection.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/famous-turkish-twitch-streamer-elraenn-switches-to-kick-heres-everything-to-know/articleshow/126327372.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/famous-turkish-twitch-streamer-elraenn-switches-to-kick-heres-everything-to-know/articleshow/126327372.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T00:43:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126327378,imgsize-966815.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sneako challenges Elon Musk’s “war” response as teenage Somali TikTok girl video explodes online]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126325614.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sneako criticized Elon Musk after Musk tweeted “Then it is war” in response to a viral TikTok threat. The clash quickly tied into the Minnesota daycare fraud debate. Musk spoke about entitlement fraud on Verdict with Ted Cruz, while officials confirmed investigations are ongoing. Governor Tim Walz has denied all fraud claims.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/sneako-challenges-elon-musks-war-response-as-teenage-somali-tiktok-girl-video-explodes-online/articleshow/126325614.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/sneako-challenges-elon-musks-war-response-as-teenage-somali-tiktok-girl-video-explodes-online/articleshow/126325614.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-03T23:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126325589,imgsize-844772.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Does Donald Trump’s takeover talk derail Machado’s bid to lead Venezuela? Here's what Polymarket says]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126326371.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Donald Trump's military operation and detention of President Maduro have significantly altered the political landscape in Venezuela. Opposition leader María Corina Machado, who hailed Maduro's capture as a "promise fulfilled" and the start of a democratic transition, now faces a more uncertain path to power. Trump indicated the U.S. would manage Venezuela during this period.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/does-donald-trumps-takeover-talk-derail-machados-bid-to-lead-venezuela-heres-what-polymarket-says/articleshow/126326371.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/does-donald-trumps-takeover-talk-derail-machados-bid-to-lead-venezuela-heres-what-polymarket-says/articleshow/126326371.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T00:39:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126327091,imgsize-61160.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Grok gone wild: Musk’s AI bot triggers chaos with Trump, Vance and bikini images]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126327255.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Elon Musk's AI chatbot, Grok, has sparked controversy by falsely branding Donald Trump a pedophile and misidentifying public figures. The bot also generated inappropriate images, including sexualized depictions of children and unauthorized bikini images of adults. Despite attempts to correct errors, Grok's erratic behavior highlights challenges in AI control.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/grok-gone-wild-musks-ai-bot-triggers-chaos-with-trump-vance-and-bikini-images/articleshow/126327255.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/grok-gone-wild-musks-ai-bot-triggers-chaos-with-trump-vance-and-bikini-images/articleshow/126327255.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-04T00:40:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126327345,imgsize-44420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Distraction from Epstein’: Democrats claim Trump's attack on Venezuela is ‘not about drugs’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126325539.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/distraction-from-epstein-file